<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Buddy First Video Editor</title>
<meta name="description" content="Works on ANY PC - Vista to 11, 1GB to 16GB RAM, any iGPU">
<style>
*{margin:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#0a0a0a;color:#e8e8e8;font:15px/1.6 -apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
.w{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px 60px}
.badge{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #1f1f1f;background:#111;color:#7a7a7a;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:18px}
h1{color:#fff;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:800}
.tag{color:#00ff88;font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 26px;letter-spacing:.01em}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#00ff88;color:#0a0a0a;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.01em}
.btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)} .btn:active{transform:scale(.98)}
.meta{color:#6a6a6a;font-size:12px;margin-top:10px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin:22px 0}
.card{border:1px solid #1f1f1f;background:#111;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 15px}
.card b{color:#fff;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
.card span{color:#8a8a8a;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.4;display:block}
.steps{border:1px solid #1f1f1f;background:#101010;border-radius:12px;padding:4px 16px;margin:18px 0}
.steps div{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;display:flex;gap:12px}
.steps div:last-child{border:0}
.n{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;background:#00ff88;color:#0a0a0a;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;flex:0 0 24px;margin-top:1px}
.s b{color:#fff;font-size:13px} .s p{color:#8a8a8a;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:2px}
.req{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:12px 0 0}
.req i{font-style:normal;border:1px solid #1f1f1f;background:#111;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:11.5px;color:#9a9a9a}
.foot{margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #151515;color:#5a5a5a;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.02em}
a{color:inherit}
@media(max-width:520px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} h1{font-size:28px} .w{padding:28px 16px 50px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="w">
<div class="badge">v1.0.0 • 45MB • BUILT ON WIN7 4GB RAM</div>
<h1>Buddy First Video Editor</h1>
<div class="tag">Works on ANY PC — Vista to 11, 1GB to 16GB RAM, any iGPU</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://github.com/BuddyBoyKij999/Buddy-First-Video-Editor/releases/tag/v1.0.0">⬇ Download for Windows (45MB)</a>
<div class="meta">No installer • No Python • Single .exe • ~2 sec download on slow net</div>

<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><b>Select video</b><span>Any format, any folder. Drag or browse.</span></div>
<div class="card"><b>Cut 5 seconds</b><span>Instant first-cut engine. Zero config.</span></div>
<div class="card"><b>output_buddy.mp4</b><span>Saved next to source. Clean naming.</span></div>
<div class="card"><b>No Python needed</b><span>Embedded ffmpeg. Works offline.</span></div>
</div>

<div class="steps">
<div><div class="n">1</div><div class="s"><b>Open BuddyFirst.exe</b><p>Double-click. No install.</p></div></div>
<div><div class="n">2</div><div class="s"><b>Select video + Cut</b><p>Pick file, hit cut. One button.</p></div></div>
<div><div class="n">3</div><div class="s"><b>Get output_buddy.mp4</b><p>Done. Same folder, ready to share.</p></div></div>
</div>

<div class="req"><i>Vista / 7 / 8 / 10 / 11</i><i>1GB RAM min</i><i>Any iGPU</i><i>x64</i><i>45MB</i></div>
<div class="foot">Built on Windows 7, 4GB RAM by <a href="https://github.com/BuddyBoyKij999" style="color:#8a8a8a">BuddyBoyKij999</a> • Pure HTML+CSS • &lt;15KB • Loads on Windows 7 Chrome</div>
</div>
</body>
